@startuml
[*] --> TaskList
TaskList --> [*] : Exit
TaskList --> AddTask : Add New Task
AddTask --> TaskList : Task Added
TaskList --> ViewTasks : View Tasks
ViewTasks --> TaskList : View Complete
TaskList --> DeleteTask : Delete Task
DeleteTask --> TaskList : Task Deleted
TaskList --> SortByTitle : Sort by Title
SortByTitle --> TaskList : Sorting Complete
TaskList --> SortByDate : Sort by Date
SortByDate --> TaskList : Sorting Complete
TaskList --> SortByPriority : Sort by Priority
SortByPriority --> TaskList : Sorting Complete
@enduml
